{"id":"4e66eeecae0f34b7","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness.md","title":"两个 DCFL 的并可以具有固有歧义","display":"thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness — 两个 DCFL 的并可以具有固有歧义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness","aliases":["73-thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness"],"display":"thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness — 两个 DCFL 的并可以具有固有歧义","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","[[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]","[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 10.5, p. 246, combined with Theorem 4.7, p. 100; scans 254, 108","legacy_source_status":"local-corollary-with-proof","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dcfl-union-nonclosure-witness — 两个 DCFL 的并可以具有固有歧义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69fb6c23bfa0fe25\" href=\"?note=69fb6c23bfa0fe25\" title=\"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar\">73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31c707c261cc66f2\" href=\"?note=31c707c261cc66f2\" title=\"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness\">73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 10.5, p. 246, combined with Theorem 4.7, p. 100; scans 254, 108"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-corollary-with-proof"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma|=4\">\\(|\\Sigma|=4\\)</span>。DCFL 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a>；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69fb6c23bfa0fe25\" href=\"?note=69fb6c23bfa0fe25\" title=\"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar\">73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"31c707c261cc66f2\" href=\"?note=31c707c261cc66f2\" title=\"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness\">73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\},\\qquad B\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\},\\qquad B\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land A\\cup B\\notin\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land A\\cup B\\notin\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A 的 DPDA 先配对 a/b 再配对 c/d；B 的 DPDA 在 a 计数之上嵌套 b/c 计数，最后再配对 d。两者都可由字符区间顺序确定当前阶段。其并是原书定理 4.7 的固有歧义语言，而 DCFL 均有无歧义文法，故该并不是 DCFL。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar","status":"resolved","id":"69fb6c23bfa0fe25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness","status":"resolved","id":"31c707c261cc66f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$ 且 $|\\Sigma|=4$。DCFL 见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 [[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]、[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar","status":"resolved","id":"69fb6c23bfa0fe25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$ 且 $|\\Sigma|=4$。DCFL 见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 [[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]、[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness","status":"resolved","id":"31c707c261cc66f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$ 且 $|\\Sigma|=4$。DCFL 见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 [[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]、[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma|=4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\},\\qquad B\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dcfl\\text{-}union\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{D